    "description": {
      "value": "New realms rise constantly in the River Kingdoms, and you intend to lead one of them. Making your reign last, however, will require both strength and grace.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Wisdom or Charisma, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Society skill and the Politics Lore skill. You gain the Courtly Graces skill feat."
